@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Tamu" as Tamu
boundary "Halaman\nRegistrasi" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Registrations" as DB
participant "WA Gateway" as WA
actor "Admin" as Admin

== Proses Registrasi Online ==

Tamu -> UI : Akses halaman registrasi
activate UI
Tamu -> UI : Isi form\n(Nama, Alamat, No. WhatsApp)
UI -> UI : Validasi format input
UI -> System : POST /api/public/register
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Validasi kelengkapan\ndata & keunikan
alt Data Tidak Valid / Duplikat
    System --> UI : Error validasi
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Tamu : Tampilkan error,\nminta isi ulang
    deactivate UI
else Data Valid
    System -> DB : INSERT registrations\n(status = pending)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : registration_id
    deactivate DB

    System -> WA : Kirim notifikasi ke Admin
    activate WA
    WA --> System : Terkirim
    deactivate WA

    System -> WA : Kirim konfirmasi ke Tamu
    activate WA
    WA --> System : Terkirim
    deactivate WA

    System --> UI : Registrasi berhasil
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Tamu : Registrasi diterima,\nmenunggu review Admin
    deactivate UI
end

@enduml
